    lvl: "med",
    q: "A stakeholder wants to skip writing a problem statement and go straight to writing a spec for 'add social sharing.' Write the problem statement you'd insist on first, based on a reasonable guess at the underlying need.",
    sol: "'Users who create a result/output they're proud of (e.g. completing a fitness goal, finishing a course module) currently have no easy way to share that achievement outside the app, so they either don't share at all (losing a potential organic growth channel) or manually screenshot and caption it themselves, which is friction-heavy enough that most don't bother.' This makes the actual goal (organic growth via shared achievements) and current workaround explicit, rather than assuming 'social sharing' (a specific solution) is definitely the right fix.",
